### ============================================================================
### CuentasClaras FX Microservice — Request Collection (.http)
### Compatible con VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
### Reemplaza las variables de abajo con los valores de tu archivo .env local
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/api/v1
@apiKey = replace_with_your_local_MICROSERVICE_API_KEY
@clientId = cuentasclaras-main-app
@clientSecret = replace_with_your_local_AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET

### 1. Health Check (200 OK - Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Catálogo de Monedas Soportadas desde API externa Frankfurter (200 OK - Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies
Accept: application/json

### 3. Consultar Tasas de Cambio Actuales (200 OK - Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rates?base=USD&symbols=MXN,EUR,CAD
Accept: application/json

### 4. Validación 400: Código de moneda inválido en query string (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rates?base=PESOS&symbols=123
Accept: application/json

### 5. Obtener Token JWT mediante credenciales de servicio (200 OK)
# @name loginService
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
  "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
}

### 6. Endpoint Protegido SIN Autenticación (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "concept": "Cena en Nueva York",
  "amount": 85.50,
  "from": "USD",
  "to": "MXN",
  "participants": 3
}

### 7. Crear Conversión de Gasto Grupal CON Autenticación Bearer (201 Created)
# @name createConversion
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-User-Id: demo-user-cuentasclaras

{
  "concept": "Cena en Nueva York",
  "amount": 120,
  "from": "USD",
  "to": "MXN",
  "participants": 4
}

### 8. Validación 400 en Endpoint Protegido: Monto negativo y moneda inválida (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "amount": -50,
  "from": "XX",
  "to": "MXN"
}

### 9. Listar Historial de Conversiones del Usuario (200 OK - Protegido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversions?limit=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-User-Id: demo-user-cuentasclaras

### 10. Eliminar una Conversión por UUID (200 OK / 404 Not Found - Protegido)
@conversionId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/conversions/{{conversionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-User-Id: demo-user-cuentasclaras

